  "description": "### ✨ New Features\n\n* **Custom branding icon** - badge on the launcher icon so the patched app is distinguishable from an unpatched install.\n* **Disable ads** - stops the ad SDK from starting (banner + pre-roll video ads).\n* **Enable background playback** - playback continues when the app is not in the foreground.\n* **Lift download restrictions** - download videos the app otherwise refuses (uploader-disabled, or longer than six hours).\n* **Unlock subscription features** - reports the account as subscribed to the app itself. Anything the server enforces is unaffected.\n\nCompatible with RuTube `31.14.2-rustore`.",
